# Web application testing.
# zaproxy (GUI) still excluded -- not requested. burpsuite (Community
# edition -- that's what Kali's own `burpsuite` package is; Pro requires
# a separate paid license this doesn't provide) added explicitly per
# direct request, revisiting the CLI-only-era exclusion noted in the
# README's Package categories section.
burpsuite

# Content discovery / fuzzing. Moved here from recon.list.chroot --
# these are web-specific, not general network/host recon.
whatweb
dirb
gobuster
ffuf
wfuzz
feroxbuster

# nikto and wpscan are listed here intentionally but commented out: both
# are verified ABSENT from kali-rolling's main/binary-amd64 archive as of
# 2026-11-11 (confirmed directly against https://kali.download's package
# index -- likely a transient rebuild/transition gap, since kali-linux-
# headless itself still hard-depends on both). Check `apt-cache policy
# nikto wpscan` against a current mirror and uncomment once they're back.
# nikto
# wpscan

sqlmap
commix
sslscan
sslyze
testssl.sh
nuclei
httpie

# From Kali's own kali-linux-headless metapackage.
cadaver
davtest
lbd
rebind
skipfish
wafw00f
webshells
weevely
qsslcaudit

